{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_title", "source_sha256": "63b7329f2e54f20affc3e33144463a5876ddd63cd8ae779969a8afd2aa85c6e0", "ja": "私らしいステージ", "zh": "自我风格的舞台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b3b27bd0e8faefd8cf06a312b7e7945a9db66e4fdc47a001374e8a7cb17fd50a", "ja": "公演のセンターに選ばれたものの、内容を\n決められない琴葉。仲間達から話を聞き、\nそれぞれの思いが詰まった公演だった事を\n知った琴葉は、自分も好きな演劇への挑戦を\n決め、見事ステージを成功させる。", "zh": "虽然被选上担任公演Center，但琴叶一直\n无法决定表演内容，于是伙伴们分享了\n之前饱含各自心意的公演内容。\n听完后，琴叶决定也要挑战自己所喜欢的\n戏剧，并顺利完成了精彩的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a87871ce1005932c9ddf8245a85238044d44120fc975d74c3fce0119f372d07", "ja": "（公演に向けたレッスンが始まって、数日……。\n琴葉は、まだやりたい事を決められないようだ）", "zh": "（公演的练习已经开始几天了……\n琴叶好像还没确定自己想做什么。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "1a43a0b0f97b0b7df3d773a7df80035f967937468df5d66ae299280b322e2299", "ja": "コトハ、ストレッチ終わったヨ～！\n次は何するノ？", "zh": "琴叶，伸展操结束啰～！\n接下来要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "79294037bf6bd61639cf40cb4ee229e127504515366ddf2aeb442e88865be1d5", "ja": "え？　そ、そうだね。\nどうしようかな……。", "zh": "咦？对、对耶。\n做什么好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "fe0a7fd78da23439da9c6e5a916ba072468729a22ca68c4fea436cb3c6b26649", "ja": "ごめんね、みんな。私、ステージで何をするか、\nまだ決められてなくて……。", "zh": "对不起，各位。\n我还没想到要做什么样的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "6f05ea249645e54f2d335c7ce225106636ee2112b87ad4f920b805602da48990", "ja": "そんなの謝るコトじゃないって～。\nそれより、やりたいコトは決まったの？", "zh": "这没什么好对不起的啦～\n先不说这个了，你找到想做的事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "efb76a8f1105cd934d84cf581a5125aec66d0a1a5639ef12d0d7408f9322016b", "ja": "ううん、まだ全然……私らしい公演って、\nいったいどんな内容にすればいいのかなって……。", "zh": "没有，完全想不到……我一直在想，\n所谓有自我风格的公演，到底应该怎么安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "d236ef18b0f1c6508b7a8761c98ca0c130cd8fea2c1d0339f84992c5cd6c9509", "ja": "う～ん、そっか。この前の\nファミレス会議だけじゃ、足りなかったか～。", "zh": "嗯～原来是这样。\n光凭之前的家庭餐厅会议，还不够啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "afe6652c0d130c8ecaef21ea0d5db538d80a9bda65cdffe4d9985e8e57dd0b64", "ja": "でしたら今日は、琴葉ちゃんのステージを\nどんな内容にするか、みんなで考えませんか～。", "zh": "那么今天，大家要不要一起来想想看\n琴叶的表演内容呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "465715eed998d959541837a09170833ce67b0706801967fa1763b3104b4f5a21", "ja": "うん、それがいいよ。みんなと一緒に考えたら、\nアイディアが浮かぶかもしれないし！", "zh": "嗯，这个主意不错。\n大家一起想，说不定能想到什么好点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "1e1d7bc86e61262d1b21727108bc0d1a478ce26537d14cb71f5e677962599711", "ja": "でも……それでもし、何も考えつかなかったら、\nみんなの時間をムダにしちゃうことに……。", "zh": "可是……万一到最后什么都没想到，\n就白白浪费大家的时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e43e9a6e545be558a5b9eca62e074f03ef2fa7526ecffa5316c84ea9c94e63c", "ja": "琴葉ってば、いろいろ気にしすぎだよ。\n誰もムダなんて思わないって！", "zh": "琴叶你就是担心太多了。\n没有人会觉得浪费的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "9dc9a893780e4eefa934eb9d162a21c67bf8bf92552e897bdede2f651f27f01c", "ja": "う、うん。でも……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e6258a74035521201eb360aebcb63907acc4aa7fa2b6117484bf45ad1d84078", "ja": "1日くらいいいんじゃないか、琴葉。\n歌やダンスのレッスンは、今のところ順調だし。", "zh": "只是花一天而已，没问题的，琴叶。\n况且歌唱和舞蹈的训练课程目前也都很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "5eca38092d0affc680f40cc91f4964d0d6e781aa270c766f607e9e28f73a70c8", "ja": "{$P$}。\nそ、そうでしょうか……。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n是、是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "dc325cfefec72dd7ac51a833e91f35775934374a257d96897d65089068bb23fa", "ja": "うん！　ワタシたち、すっごく順調だと思うヨ♪\nね、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！我们也都觉得很顺利喔♪\n对不对，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8549fd622f8cc21aeed9c0603e604d0a906eb48b2fd454ee04f2fef1f2bbb808", "ja": "ああ。レッスンには支障がないんだ。\nせっかくだし、みんなに相談してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "是啊，这不会影响到训练的。\n机会难得，就跟大家商量看看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "368f9c3cd19f44c9d222f6b426d828c120418e82902445e8709a4581b1960be5", "ja": "わかりました。……みんな。\nみんなの時間を、私にください！", "zh": "我知道了……各位。\n请把大家的时间借给我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9e69af15f2bc770b856fc25e5be7995d0570516a64639927f2e08de87b6c8f21", "ja": "へへっ、その言葉を待ってたよ！\nもちろん協力するよ、琴葉！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我就等你说这句话！\n我们当然会帮你，琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "25810d148fdfd1fb760d4c70e4c8a02bbbb1060debbc31a96fb2217e55ef08f5", "ja": "はい～。\nでは、まずは何から始めましょうか～？", "zh": "好的～\n那么，要从什么地方开始呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "0d817142b031b739f1da40866ff8f31814a6f93656ebfdebb5d7fc1954b4a09c", "ja": "じゃあ……改めてになるけど、みんなはセンター公演の\nときに、何をしたかったのか聞いてもいいかな？", "zh": "那就……我可不可以再问一下，\n大家在之前的Center公演时，都想做些什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "3ddc99158784791df908b73a991723759bb25032855c0eb7284d30d3d7c372e9", "ja": "ハイハーイ！　それじゃ、ワタシからネ！\nワタシは、やっぱりダンスだヨ！", "zh": "我我我──！那就从我先开始吧！\n我最想要的还是跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "94d5df95cc42eee8896d380e5f0980aadf464a017f67ec386358f4ae76c1ef0b", "ja": "でも、ひとりでじゃないヨ？　みんなと一緒に、\n笑顔で楽しく踊りたかったノ♪　気持ちよかったナ～♪", "zh": "但可不是自己一个人跳喔？当时我希望的是跟大家一起，\n笑容满面地享受舞蹈♪那时真的很开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d27fdc7a987b50f61b9a079a2cd381bd44032ac755e62b1cb3cfc3cdc4cb3454", "ja": "アタシも同じかな。でもアタシは、劇場の仲間や\nファンのみんなとの、ユニゾンを意識したんだ！", "zh": "我也差不多吧。不过我有特别去意识到，\n自己跟剧场的伙伴还有粉丝们之间的Unison！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0b5d07e5451420595f5f721f6da0f7c31af88e1dc31746c6775a870f3b8f8b0a", "ja": "全員の動きをビシッってシンクロさせたら、\nめちゃくちゃカッコイイだろうなって思ってさ！", "zh": "因为我想，若能让所有人的动作俐落地同步在一起，\n一定会显得超级帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "b61ccb16aebc41d657d16e4cb0abefa1606afd8dd88895fece88b401538320df", "ja": "なるほど……。えっと、恵美と美也は？\nセンター公演のとき、どうだった？", "zh": "原来如此……那惠美跟美也呢？\n你们的Center公演怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "1aba566a271c628bc955b035d337c529d2eaebbca947d1df91dc2aa34ab6afc0", "ja": "私は、劇場は楽しいってことを伝えたくて～。\n終わったら、笑顔でいっぱいの公演でしたよ～。", "zh": "我当时想把剧场的乐趣传达给大家～\n那场公演结束后，大家都笑得很开心喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "e3092757ee731c9e8fbacabd05fd417622f93cb0a860c249e86cfca95679d237", "ja": "うんうん！　やっぱ、会場中が\n楽しくって、ノリノリになれるのがいいよね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！最棒的就是看整个会场的气氛沸腾，\n让大家嗨翻天了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "01cee10152c6b47f4f31e1c9b9731da0ca41823e6dbe5e83e15abd85f4802783", "ja": "ま、始まる前はアタシもいっぱいいっぱいだったから、\nあんまりえらそうなコトは言えないんだけどねっ。", "zh": "不过我开演前也是紧张到不行，\n所以没办法说什么大话就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "6b61913ebc945346b39ad4b61b7b3c550606bbee53abe46119143e682371fbd8", "ja": "なんと、そうでしたか～。\n恵美ちゃん、がんばったんですね～。", "zh": "居然是这样呀～\n惠美真的很努力呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "814a89f8fa8d16e9cc9e967e61004ff5a9181503bf0792f1e5d4f09b5a917f0d", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう。\n……みんなの話、すごく参考になったよ。", "zh": "各位，谢谢你们。\n……大家的意见都非常有参考价值喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "076b11f147e972d8689ec5d96c5f4a246b0bee790602961b85fb338e1bb8833b", "ja": "{$P$}も、ありがとうございます。\n私、大事なことを忘れていたかもしれません……。", "zh": "也要谢谢{$P$}。\n或许我之前忘了很重要的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2c2619a24103ac2b0be1ffac56825e2efde38000afbc181ec34d0208d9fc99bc", "ja": "大事な事？", "zh": "重要的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "4a5cea5caf72d31d8b40a6ac96bac9d38f8df2d2645bd61b4a687f4093d037fd", "ja": "はい。センター公演は、センターに立った人の\n思いが、ギュッと詰めこまれた公演です。", "zh": "是的。站在Center位置的人，其心意会凝聚在\n演出之中，这才是所谓的Center公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "5d5a38d6611cdfec7ca4b57deca2a1c65f60e5cac6a6af06fc0838b790201966", "ja": "個性はもちろんありますけど、気持ちの熱量が\nすごいって……そのことが、よくわかりました。", "zh": "虽然大家的个性各有不同，但我着实了解了……\n心意的热度很强大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1034_p", "source_sha256": "30c5e1d0df9a502f37df2be8124e75ef02b78754e5a59cb6f65fe07e3e1e9985", "ja": "そうだな。公演でセンターに立つアイドルは、全員が\n全員、アイドルに対して違う思いを持ってるだろう。", "zh": "对啊，每一场公演中担任Center的人，\n对偶像的看法应该都不同吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1035_p", "source_sha256": "bff220c571c1f141502223bdcad8c571e0553d20b20391a44832d0b61bb1ec05", "ja": "でもきっと、最後に願う事は、ひとつなんだ。", "zh": "不过，大家最后许下的愿望，一定是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "e8e935390e400dfff51e2814a96a86caa2978dffa60f7f792afd29837f099fc3", "ja": "……最後に、願うこと。", "zh": "……最后许下的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "166390f551bcbc4448bde98096e1d791b7a264620df45c243779b5536424bd25", "ja": "ねーねー、琴葉は？　アタシたちの話聞いて、\n何がしたいとか、浮かんだ？", "zh": "欸～欸～那琴叶呢？听了我们的想法之后，\n你有想到自己想做什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "94a68b17c4d125111da84c67618d59dac5e1cb0d79daeadf145558c89c8754d4", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、うん。ちょっとだけ、\n挑戦してみたいかもってことが……。", "zh": "咦……啊，嗯。我想到了一件，\n自己有点想挑战看看的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "e8b451cf4ecd0a43c210b45429caf8e67e7f918adaed2356dc9bdb7d4d1f7d0d", "ja": "えーっ。コトハ、何がしたいノ？\nねえねえ、教えてよ、コトハ～♪", "zh": "咦～琴叶想做的是什么？\n欸欸，告诉我们嘛，琴叶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "fe07eb54eac7895ebb090a32ed890a90e2cd85618a3a9c2f841aeda133186899", "ja": "でも、みんなと一緒のステージだし。\nみんなの意見も聞いて……。", "zh": "不过，毕竟大家要一起表演。\n应该也要听听你们的意见才是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "c15adeb81253c5d87befc5c2807e9e0c6b6a1cd72ae0020947709030006dc1d3", "ja": "私たちのことは、気にしないでください～。\n今回の公演のセンターは、琴葉ちゃんですから～。", "zh": "请别担心我们～\n这次公演的Center可是琴叶啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "7a0bd13b381861db90ab524859ba5fe88ce4c0018b7320997640c99142aecbd5", "ja": "そうそう。せっかく自分のセンター公演なんだから、\nちょっとくらい、ワガママ言ってもいいんじゃない？", "zh": "没错没错，这可是你自己的Center公演。\n机会难得，稍微任性一点也可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1029512c094716e3e7646e799dcb221561c129fd442a4c971bdbbf7471a9058a", "ja": "何でも言ってよ、琴葉！　どんな公演でも、\nアタシたちが全力でサポートするからさ！", "zh": "有什么想法尽管说，琴叶！无论是什么样的公演，\n我们都会尽全力协助你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1044_017kth", "source_sha256": "c41d5c10089a4a72b199e2717d1d735ae00d5e0fac5b956c7e5a0fb1ae2dabe1", "ja": "で、でも。できるかどうか、\n{$P$}に相談してみないと……。", "zh": "可、可是，我得先跟{$P$}\n商量看看，才知道有没有可能做到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1045_p", "source_sha256": "0936f08057b82fad3e19ce42f761f9b10bdc9fed0944addca33095230b78f891", "ja": "そうだな、何か難しい挑戦なら、遠慮なく相談して\nみてほしい。できるかどうかは、一緒に考えよう。", "zh": "嗯，如果有什么困难的挑战，我希望你能尽量找我商量。\n我们一起思考有没有办法做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "f815d997392771b99728017a4855ab25f29c596b786cc4dd2ff8d6eff0a0a0e3", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\n……私、前から考えていたことがあるんです。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢你。\n……我之前就一直有个想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1047_017kth", "source_sha256": "6c158cf31e8a27e1eb0f63f40c35e7e38ef7b5dd65bc49f0ba0043f0fbab46fb", "ja": "ステージに、その……\nお芝居の要素を、取り入れてみたいと思って。", "zh": "我想在表演中……那个……\n试着放入演戏的元素。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1048_p", "source_sha256": "0fbca366b4df1de53ea989c97210de0359022b01c65ec9b104ab587355dd59d0", "ja": "お芝居？　……というと？", "zh": "演戏？\n……怎么说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1049_017kth", "source_sha256": "ec07263f44b019c5c24f7dae348e7427905fd69ef657d96e9695c36844fe0640", "ja": "はい。お芝居って、ずっと同じことを\n繰り返しているようにも見えますけど……。", "zh": "嗯。所谓的演戏，乍看之下像是\n一直重复着相同的事情，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1050_017kth", "source_sha256": "d1449067d6d04b12b1ce5cfc8a344a78b9cef8e52d735e5e7969dcb1c2b0dc83", "ja": "生きている人にとって、その瞬間は一度きり。\n……一度きりを生きるために、練習を重ねるんです。", "zh": "对于活着的人来说，那个瞬间只有一次。\n……为了活出仅此一次的瞬间，不停地反复练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "788b4a5732da68ea17afe20bac1500b14650779efef08908547b173152ead77b", "ja": "アイドルのステージも、一度きりのために、\nたくさんのレッスンをします。だから……。", "zh": "偶像的表演也是，为了那仅止一次的瞬间，\n我们会进行大量的训练，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1052_p", "source_sha256": "e29712701ce55fc891397cdf123872a4337d018dc8e268eca64894d54503adab", "ja": "なるほど。\n確かに、アイドルのステージと同じだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n的确跟偶像的表演一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1053_017kth", "source_sha256": "56366257264e387c66b8d81cc615aff9dac0cc58b60c2bede3b9674ce72ecf91", "ja": "はい！　私のセンター公演も、そんなふうに……\n瞬間の輝きを見せられるステージにできたらって。", "zh": "没错！我希望自己的Center公演也能像那样……\n成为一场展现出瞬间光辉的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1054_017kth", "source_sha256": "83e632c55d7dfe3d5eabc4d7dda7bff6c88cca63fcb20c758ade36eba0d85c28", "ja": "でも、具体的にどうすればいいのかまでは……。\nそれが、本当にお客さんに届くのかどうかも……。", "zh": "不过，我还没想到具体上要怎么呈现……\n也不确定能否将这份心意传达给观众……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1055_p", "source_sha256": "7a12ea67884a2b23d46bbc676c0201db71878305f582a760c43058ca2ab57028", "ja": "好きなお芝居と、アイドルを似てると思った。\n琴葉にとって、大切な気づきだと思うよ。", "zh": "琴叶觉得自己喜欢的戏剧跟偶像很相似。\n我觉得这对你来说，是一个很重要的发现喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_1057", "source_sha256": "4838a6582b7bdc509907a00b2d3d5ad83a9e2adaa08636f6057682af0facac26", "ja": "信じろ！", "zh": "相信自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_2000_p", "source_sha256": "90cd49cc81c0e69030f719a5a526f1db22426320f0c50c428dc3bceb3a03116a", "ja": "なら、信じてみよう！\n琴葉の、自分自身の気持ちを。自由な心を。", "zh": "那么，你就试着去相信吧！\n相信琴叶自己的感受。相信自由的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_2001_017kth", "source_sha256": "10e9c085d6c8463afcb28045a765092d09abe834eaece4e22374bbfc91eb4b3c", "ja": "私の、私自身の気持ち……。そうですよね。\nやりたいことがあるなら、挑戦してみなくちゃ……！", "zh": "我自己的感受……说得也是。\n既然有了想做的事，就得去挑战看看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_2002_017kth", "source_sha256": "6f3ee171c8432500fa838c917b134d079d0badb3c913d03cf15099cae9c118ae", "ja": "{$P$}。失敗するかもしれません。\nそれでも……私、挑戦してみてもいいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}。我说不定会失败。\n尽管如此……我可以挑战看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_2003_017kth", "source_sha256": "ccb9d943c610aa5dc89908c505a784d9a4ff400433fcd070e477edb576a0cdef", "ja": "その先に、どんな景色が待ってるのか、\n私、この目で確かめてみたいです！", "zh": "我想用自己的眼睛试着见证，\n前方有什么样的景色在等着我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_034_2004_p", "source_sha256": "a38ff6998107706f2d72cdd9c2b314510b4abc46e74d46432a3aaf4de7b5f1eb", "ja": "ああ。やってみよう！", "zh": "当然可以，试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
